Do not treat compiler warnings as errors

set_compiler_options() adds -Werror=... options through add_compile_options(),
which places them after CXXFLAGS so they can't be turned off with
-Wno-error=... from the recipe. Keep the warnings, but don't make them fatal.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe specific]

